      en: ["Located on Ometepe Island at the base of the Maderas Volcano.", "Built using over 1,000,000 recycled plastic bottles filled with sand.", "Directly funds the Ometepe Bilingual School for local children.", "Features a wastewater treatment system using aquatic plants.", "The site was historically part of a major agricultural estate.", "Home to a high concentration of Howler monkeys and diverse birdlife."],
