      en: ["The canopy course features 9 distinct platforms linked by high-tension cables.", "Certain sections provide a 360-degree view of the Pacific and Lake Nicaragua.", "The facility is located just a 10-minute drive from San Juan del Sur's bay.", "Mantled howler monkeys are frequently seen within meters of the zip platforms.", "Instructors are trained in international safety and emergency response protocols.", "The park contributes to local reforestation efforts in the Rivas area."],
